{"author":{"id":"417295a7cc0952a9a38b67be3a894daed91f9069f7407e038d12a4f9b9a8451e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792345310,"nonce":"pDOoIwtg4sgJAQfxRlBDStupFH0=","title":"rayscript-gc: run the suite under Miri","message":"The heap is raw-memory unsafe code. The suite passes in debug and release, under AddressSanitizer, and catches 26 injected bugs, but Miri is not installed here and has not run. Heavy tests are marked ignored under Miri and loop counts are reduced, untried.\n\nTo run: rustup component add miri --toolchain nightly \u0026\u0026 cargo +nightly miri test -p rayscript-gc\n\nAlso open: the droppable bit lives in a side table, not Header.flags, so the VM must keep passing droppable to alloc; Heap has no Drop that runs destructors, so owners tear down with an empty begin_collect/end_collect (Vm does).","files":null}]}